WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:10.809
"Wait for me!" Sasha yelled.

2
00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:15.115
Sasha, Mo, and Cora were racing.

3
00:00:15.116 --> 00:00:19.967
They stopped and waited for Sasha.

4
00:00:19.968 --> 00:00:25.331
"Sorry!" she said. "I'm so slow."

5
00:00:25.332 --> 00:00:28.528
"I'm slow too," Mo said.

6
00:00:28.529 --> 00:00:32.345
"You're faster than me!" Sasha said.

7
00:00:32.346 --> 00:00:35.377
Cora felt bad for Sasha.

8
00:00:35.378 --> 00:00:41.085
"Maybe you need more practice," she said.

9
00:00:41.086 --> 00:00:44.985
"Cora, Sasha! Look!" Mo cried.

10
00:00:44.986 --> 00:00:49.448
A herd of colorful seahorses was going by.

11
00:00:49.449 --> 00:00:53.541
"They're so pretty," Sasha said.

12
00:00:53.542 --> 00:00:56.854
The friends watched them pass.

13
00:00:56.855 --> 00:00:59.055
Cora whispered to Mo.

14
00:00:59.056 --> 00:01:02.708
"Let's give Sasha a head start next time."

15
00:01:02.709 --> 00:01:06.844
"Good idea!" Mo said.

16
00:01:06.845 --> 00:01:10.320
The friends started racing again.

17
00:01:10.321 --> 00:01:14.818
Sasha started first.

18
00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:18.798
But Mo and Cora quickly caught up.

19
00:01:18.799 --> 00:01:32.311
Sasha sighed. "I'll never win a race!"

20
00:01:32.312 --> 00:01:36.154
Just then a red seahorse swam over.

21
00:01:36.155 --> 00:01:38.487
"My name is Hal," he said.

22
00:01:38.488 --> 00:01:42.577
"I'm looking for my mate, Sal!"

23
00:01:42.578 --> 00:01:45.612
Hal looked worried.

24
00:01:45.613 --> 00:01:48.122
"I swam ahead of Sal.

25
00:01:48.123 --> 00:01:50.986
When I looked back, she was gone.

26
00:01:50.987 --> 00:01:54.611
I don't know where she went."

27
00:01:54.612 --> 00:01:58.759
"We can help you," Cora said.

28
00:01:58.760 --> 00:02:00.820
"Wait here."

29
00:02:00.821 --> 00:02:03.594
She looked at Mo and Sasha.

30
00:02:03.595 --> 00:02:13.883
"Come on! Let's go to the compass!"

